			<Version>0.1.0</Version>
			<Description>OPTIONAL. Sample objects for demonstrating OSCA Admin on a FRESH IRIS install only. Adds the /api/osca-showcase REST application. Nothing is created at install: the portal's Showcase page creates the osca_demo_ objects only after every fresh-install check passes and the user types a confirmation phrase. Do not install on a real server.</Description>
